  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 403.09 Timber Design Criteria",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 403.09 Timber Design Criteria. The department shall use one or more of the following texts in evaluating the competence of the submitted design:\n\n(a) “Timber Construction Manual” by the American Institute of Timber Construction, Sixth Edition, dated 2012, available as noted in Appendix B; or\n\n(b) “2018 National Design Specification for Wood Construction” by the American Wood Council, dated 2018, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
